WEBVTT

00:38:28.199 --> 00:38:31.889
And it's a subtle difference,
but it's also a profound one.

00:38:31.913 --> 00:38:35.315
It's recognizing that there
are some children who will engage

00:38:35.339 --> 00:38:37.258
with material and with their classmates

00:38:37.282 --> 00:38:39.686
not by raising their hand again and again

00:38:39.710 --> 00:38:43.661
but by showing in quieter ways
that they're paying attention.

00:38:43.685 --> 00:38:46.945
Maybe when the teacher
divides the kids up into small groups,

00:38:46.969 --> 00:38:49.446
that's when they're really
starting to participate

00:38:49.470 --> 00:38:52.750
and to share their ideas
and elicit ideas from others.

00:38:52.774 --> 00:38:57.052
And we actually have a tool -- and
all this stuff is free on QuietRev.com --

00:38:57.076 --> 00:39:01.798
but we have a tool
for teachers to use where they can...